# Project data (runtime-generated, not source)
# Ignore the dir's CONTENTS (data/*) — NOT the dir itself — so the negations
# below can re-include specific durability-critical files. (A bare `data/`
# ignores the directory entirely and git never evaluates the negations.)
data/*
# Durability-critical state: MUST be tracked so board survives disk loss / rebuild.
# These are small, append-only/regenerable — safe to commit.
!data/issues_cache.json
!data/last_run.json
!data/processed_issues.json
.omo/

# Logs
*.log
